## 13. Module deep-dive checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + module path verification
- [ ] Every `file:line` reference in body tagged `[verified]` or `[estimated]`
- [ ] Public API surface (section 7) re-read from clone before commit
- [ ] DDL snippets (section 8) verified against a real migration file
- [ ] >=50% of references are `[verified]` (otherwise escalate for re-dissect)

### Scope

- [ ] Module path and boundary unambiguous
- [ ] Excluded paths listed
- [ ] Why-this-module justified

### Models

- [ ] All models listed with storage and purpose
- [ ] Inheritance tree captured
- [ ] Notable fields called out

### Surface

- [ ] Controllers / handlers listed with auth requirements
- [ ] Views / serializers listed
- [ ] Internal & external deps enumerated
- [ ] Extendable hooks documented
- [ ] Public API surface stable subset identified

### Schema

- [ ] Tables captured (DDL with indexes)
- [ ] Migration files referenced

### Quality

- [ ] Performance numbers cited from real benchmarks (or marked estimated)
- [ ] Security concerns scored with file:line reference
- [ ] Portability scored using extract-components rubric

### Hand-off

- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/deep-dive/module-<name>.md`
- [ ] Cross-link from `wiki/modules.md`
- [ ] Tier label matches `extract-components.md`